abstract: >-
  An unpublished Lean 4 development snapshot accompanying Models for dagger
  (infinity,1)-categories I: Dagger simplicial sets and unitary cores. The local
  retained source build, axiom audit, Comparator and default-kernel replay cover
  public Theorem B, generic Theorem C and Theorem D aliases in the saved
  2767-module scope. The separate Theorem A bridge passed the current
  2771-module local build, expanded all-owner audit and A-specific Comparator
  with default-kernel replay. New 2771-source B/C/D re-export comparison remains
  pending.
  Unprivileged Linux CI and independent human manuscript review remain pending.
  Apache-2.0 covers original companion code and documentation. Applicable
  distribution terms for some copied third-party sources remain unconfirmed;
  see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
